{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --accent: #7CE3B6;
      --muted: #9aa4b2;
      --card-radius:16px;
      --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --glass-glow: rgba(124,227,182,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color: #e6eef6;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071025 0%, #071825 60%);}
    /* Decorative SVG sits behind everything */
    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14;mix-blend-mode:overlay}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:22px 36px;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);}
    .nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;width:100%;}
    .brand{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.4px}
    .nav-right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:12px}
    a.nav-link{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px}
    a.nav-link:hover{background:var(--glass);color:#eaf7f0}

    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));border-radius:var(--card-radius);padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--glass-border);box-shadow:0 6px 30px var(--glass-glow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}

    /* Contact form */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,input[type=tel],input[type=date],select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);background:transparent;color:inherit}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5fd5c2);color:#04201a;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border:none}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}

    /* Right column: proof gallery + timeline */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    .testimonial{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .test-author{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7CE3B6,#5fd5c2);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#04201a}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .badge{padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);font-size:12px;position:relative}
    .badge:hover .tip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    .tip{position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(6px);background:#03121a;color:#bfeee0;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;transition:all .16s ease}

    /* Timeline */
    .timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .phase{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .phase .info{flex:1}
    .phase input[type=range]{width:160px}
    .summary{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);font-size:14px}
    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#b4c6d1;margin-top:8px}

    /* Small screens */
    @media (max-width:980px){
      .container{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}
      nav{padding:12px}
      .nav-inner{gap:12px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 800 600" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="p1" x="0" y="0" width="64" height="64" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="64" height="64" fill="#08202a" />
        <path d="M0 32 L64 32 M32 0 L32 64" stroke="#09313a" stroke-width="1"/>
        <circle cx="48" cy="16" r="2" fill="#7CE3B6" opacity="0.6"/>
        <circle cx="16" cy="48" r="2" fill="#5fd5c2" opacity="0.5"/>
      </pattern>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#06202b" stop-opacity="0.8"/>
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#072432" stop-opacity="0.6"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.6" />
  </svg>

  <nav>
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <a class="nav-link" href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="about.html">Team</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="book.html">Schedule</a>
      <div class="nav-right"><a class="nav-link" href="contact.html">Contact</a></div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="panel">
      <h1>Connect with our clinical design team</h1>
      <p class="lead">Request a focused consultation, an exploratory VIP day, or ask about tailored short programs. We work with you on a practical plan rooted in integrative evidence and personalised priorities.</p>

      <form id="contactForm" class="contact-form" onsubmit="submitForm(event)">
        <div class="row">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" required>
          </div>
          <div style="width:160px">
            <label for="when">Preferred date</label>
            <input id="when" type="date">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>
          </div>
          <div style="width:160px">
            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="phone" type="tel" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <label for="message">What would you like to focus on?</label>
          <textarea id="message" placeholder="Brief note (symptoms, goals, questions)"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;align-items:center">
          <button class="cta" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
          <div class="meta">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div style="margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">We do not offer medical guarantees. Information shared here is educational and meant to support clinical conversations. By contacting us you agree to receive a reply within business hours.</div>
    </section>

    <aside class="panel">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">ORGANIZE AN INTENSIVE</div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">Concierge Reset — one focused day</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="proof" style="margin-top:14px">
        <div id="testimonial" class="testimonial">
          <div id="quote">Loading client perspective...</div>
          <div class="test-author">
            <div class="avatar" id="avatar">AB</div>
            <div>
              <div id="author" style="font-weight:700"></div>
              <div id="role" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="badges" id="badges" aria-hidden="false">
            <!-- badges inserted by JS -->
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Trust signals</div>
          <div>
            <button onclick="prevTestimonial()" style="background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer">◀</button>
            <button onclick="nextTestimonial()" style="background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer">▶</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline" style="margin-top:10px">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Design your three-step planner</div>

          <div class="phase">
            <div class="info">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Phase 1 — Stabilize</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Short-term steps to reduce strain and clarify priorities</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <input type="range" id="p1" min="1" max="12" value="2" oninput="updateTimeline()">
            </div>
            <div><strong id="v1">2w</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div class="phase">
            <div class="info">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Phase 2 — Build</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Targeted practices, laboratory review, and tailored coaching</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <input type="range" id="p2" min="2" max="24" value="8" oninput="updateTimeline()">
            </div>
            <div><strong id="v2">8w</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div class="phase">
            <div class="info">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Phase 3 — Integrate</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Practice consolidation and planning for long-term maintenance</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <input type="range" id="p3" min="4" max="52" value="16" oninput="updateTimeline()">
            </div>
            <div><strong id="v3">16w</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div class="summary" id="summary">Total program length: <strong id="total">26 weeks</strong></div>
          <div class="disclaimer">This planner is a design tool, not a prescription. Actual timeline, tests, and recommendations will be personalized during clinical conversations.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <script>
    // --- Proof Gallery (rotating testimonials + credibility badges) ---
    const testimonials = [
      {quote: 'A practical sequence that respected my schedule and medical context. I appreciated the clear checkpoints.', name: 'Claire R.', role: 'Project Manager', initials: 'CR', badges:['MD-reviewed','Research-sourced','Local clinic partner']},
      {quote: 'Concise, evidence-aware guidance with tangible actions I could try within a week.', name: 'Jamal H.', role: 'Teacher', initials: 'JH', badges:['Clinically informed','Functional testing','Insurance-friendly']},
      {quote: 'The focused day clarified next steps and saved months of guesswork.', name: 'Sofia M.', role: 'Entrepreneur', initials: 'SM', badges:['Outcome-tracked','Peer-reviewed','Telehealth available']}
    ];

    const badgeTips = {
      'MD-reviewed': 'Clinical oversight by licensed practitioners.',
      'Research-sourced': 'Interventions selected from peer-reviewed literature.',
      'Local clinic partner': 'In-person options via partnered clinic network.',
      'Clinically informed': 'Protocols shaped by clinical experience and data.',
      'Functional testing': 'Optional functional labs to support planning.',
      'Insurance-friendly': 'Some services may be billed to insurance.',
      'Outcome-tracked': 'Progress monitored with repeat assessments.',
      'Peer-reviewed': 'Approaches vetted by multidisciplinary review.',
      'Telehealth available': 'Remote appointments available for convenience.'
    };

    let idx = 0;
    let rotator;
    function renderTestimonial(i){
      const t = testimonials[i % testimonials.length];
      document.getElementById('quote').textContent = '“' + t.quote + '”';
      document.getElementById('author').textContent = t.name;
      document.getElementById('role').textContent = t.role;
      document.getElementById('avatar').textContent = t.initials;
      const badges = document.getElementById('badges');
      badges.innerHTML = '';
      t.badges.forEach(b=>{
        const el = document.createElement('div');
        el.className = 'badge';
        el.textContent = b;
        const tip = document.createElement('div');
        tip.className = 'tip';
        tip.textContent = badgeTips[b] || '';
        el.appendChild(tip);
        badges.appendChild(el);
      });
    }
    function nextTestimonial(){ idx = (idx+1) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(idx); resetRotator(); }
    function prevTestimonial(){ idx = (idx-1 + testimonials.length) % testimonials.length; renderTestimonial(idx); resetRotator(); }
    function resetRotator(){ clearInterval(rotator); rotator = setInterval(()=>nextTestimonial(),4000); }

    // --- Timeline planner ---
    function updateTimeline(){
      const p1 = Number(document.getElementById('p1').value);
      const p2 = Number(document.getElementById('p2').value);
      const p3 = Number(document.getElementById('p3').value);
      document.getElementById('v1').textContent = p1 + 'w';
      document.getElementById('v2').textContent = p2 + 'w';
      document.getElementById('v3').textContent = p3 + 'w';
      const weeks = p1 + p2 + p3;
      const months = Math.round((weeks/4)*10)/10;
      document.getElementById('total').textContent = weeks + ' weeks (' + months + ' months)';

      // Gentle nudges
      const summaryEl = document.getElementById('summary');
      if(weeks < 8) summaryEl.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,180,120,0.06), rgba(255,200,140,0.03))';
      else summaryEl.style.background = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.02)';
    }

    // --- Contact form handler (mock) ---
    function submitForm(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value || '';
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value || '';
      const when = document.getElementById('when').value || 'unspecified';
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value || '';
      // Lightweight validation
      if(!email || !name){
        alert('Please include a name and an email to request a reply.');
        return;
      }
      // Simulate send
      const px = document.createElement('div');
      px.style.position='fixed';px.style.left='50%';px.style.top='20px';px.style.transform='translateX(-50%)';px.style.background='#04201a';px.style.color='#bfeee0';px.style.padding='10px 14px';px.style.borderRadius='10px';px.style.boxShadow='0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)';
      px.textContent = 'Thanks — we will reply within business hours.';
      document.body.appendChild(px);
      setTimeout(()=>px.remove(),4200);
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
    }

    // Initialize
    renderTestimonial(0);
    rotator = setInterval(()=>nextTestimonial(),4000);
    updateTimeline();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Project: holistic_medicine — contact page (chunk 4)

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html  -> Standalone contact page with glass-style UI, rotating proof gallery, and an interactive three-phase timeline planner.
- README.md     -> This file.

Placeholders (replace in your deployment):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Key features implemented locally (no external services):
- Timeline planner: three phases (Stabilize, Build, Integrate) controlled by range inputs. Shows computed total weeks/months and gentle visual nudges. Includes a disclaimer: the planner is a design tool and not a prescription.
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials with manual prev/next controls. Each testimonial displays credibility badges; hovering a badge reveals a tooltip describing the signal.
- Contact form: collects name, email, phone, preferred date, and message. Form is handled client-side (mock submission) and shows a transient confirmation. No back-end wired in this chunk.

Design notes:
- Glass morphism visual language implemented with translucent panels, subtle borders, and glow.
- Decorative SVG pattern is embedded inline to avoid external assets. (Note: other chunks may place an external assets/img/pattern.svg; this page includes its own background SVG for uniqueness.)
- Navigation uses a different label set: Home, Offerings, Conditions, Method, Investment, Team, Schedule, Contact

Accessibility & content:
- No guaranteed cures are stated. The page uses an educational/supportive tone and explicitly notes that information is not a prescription.
- Replace placeholder values before publishing. Links in the top navigation point to the expected pages: index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html

How to test locally:
1. Save contact.html to a folder with the rest of the site, or open it directly in a modern browser.
2. Interact with the timeline sliders; observe totals and visual feedback.
3. Watch the testimonial rotation and hover badges to see tooltips.
4. Submit the contact form (it is a mock — no external network calls).

Notes for integration:
- Replace the mock form handler with an actual API endpoint ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} or similar) in production.
- Ensure placeholders are injected by your templating system before publishing.

License: project content is provided as-is for site assembly and reference."}
